# Proof & Profit – Android App Development

## Project Overview

Proof & Profit is an Android application I am developing to help home bakery owners manage their daily business activities. The goal is to make it easier to organize customer orders, track baking schedules, calculate expenses, and understand profits.

As someone who enjoys baking from home, I wanted to create an application that solves a problem I have experienced personally. Keeping track of orders, ingredients, and customer payments can become challenging, especially when managing several orders at once.

## Why This Application Is Important

I believe business innovation does not always require creating something completely new. Sometimes, improving an everyday process can make a meaningful difference. Proof & Profit would bring several bakery management tasks into one application instead of requiring multiple notebooks or spreadsheets.

## Planned Application Features

- Customer order management
- Baking schedule and pickup dates
- Ingredient and expense tracking
- Profit calculations
- Simple navigation for home bakery owners

## Development Tools

For this project, I plan to explore and use:

- Android Studio
- Android SDK
- Java and XML
- MIT App Inventor
- GitHub
- Justinmind for wireframing

## Project Documentation

This Wiki will document my progress throughout the course, including setting up Android development tools, creating my first application, designing wireframes, and testing application features.

My goal is to develop an application that is practical, organized, and easy for small bakery owners to use.
